Package: ootable
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: UNICODE TABLES
 Renders markdown, JSON, or CSV into auto-sized Unicode terminal grid tables.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
